===Etymology 2===
{{unk|en}}. Perhaps from ''The Dong with a Luminous Nose'', an 1894 poem by {{w|Edward Lear}} about a mythical creature. Attested since the 1930s.

====Noun====
{{en-noun}}

# {{lb|en|slang}} The [[penis]].
