#* {{quote-book|en|year=1969|author=Philip Roth|title=Portnoy’s Complaint|page=18|text=Nevertheless, I was wholly incapable of keeping my paws from my '''dong''' once it started the climb up my belly.}}
#* {{quote-text|en|year=1983|chapter=Penis Song|title=w:Monty Python's The Meaning of Life
|passage=Isn't it awfully nice to have a penis?<br>Isn't it frightfully good to have a '''dong'''?}}
# {{lb|en|slang|by extension}} A [[dildo]], specifically a [[synthetic]] [[anatomical]] [[replica]] of the penis.

